# Test, lint and type-check tools for the CI jobs, compiled with hashes into
# ci.txt. Constrained to the versions in poetry.lock, so CI runs the tools a
# developer's `poetry install` gives them; unpinned, an upstream release of
# any of them could change a verdict or fail the build overnight.
#
# Unlike the other sets this one is compiled universally (every Python from
# 3.10 and every OS), because the test matrix installs it on all of them.
#
# Regenerate with: python scripts/compile_requirements.py
pytest
pytest-cov
hypothesis
ruff
mypy
tomli
